| 8 | Delivery Timeline | Phases with weeks or dates, from kickoff not from signature |
| 9 | Client Costs & Third-party Items | Hosting, domain, email, stores, and other vendor bills the client pays |
| 10 | Assumptions & Dependencies | What must be true, and what the client must supply |
